        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "块 is an informal unit of yuan and can also count pieces. Money amounts do not take another 个 before 块.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这本书十块钱。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū shí kuài qián 。",
                "meaning": "This book costs ten yuan.",
